{"id":"ec93c08d698f2539","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle.md","title":"循环图的无穷访问树","display":"ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle — 循环图的无穷访问树","type":"example","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"example","label":"56-ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle","aliases":["56-ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle"],"display":"ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle — 循环图的无穷访问树","depends_on":["[[56-df-signature]]","[[56-df-term-graph]]","[[56-df-graph-access-path]]","[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]","[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]","[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]","[[56-thm-term-graph-unravelling-homomorphism]]","[[56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling]]"],"source_section":"§13.2 Definitions 13.2.7–13.2.9; cyclic access-path illustration","source_printed_pages":"716–717","source_ocr_blocks":[737,738],"source_verification":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle — 循环图的无穷访问树"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a4fa7874f12cc27\" href=\"?note=7a4fa7874f12cc27\" title=\"56-df-graph-access-path\">56-df-graph-access-path</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c088d04d4303598\" href=\"?note=1c088d04d4303598\" title=\"56-df-graph-unravelling\">56-df-graph-unravelling</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4a9c89b3e42d1880\" href=\"?note=4a9c89b3e42d1880\" title=\"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism\">56-df-term-graph-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9a89c52b489c33b7\" href=\"?note=9a89c52b489c33b7\" title=\"56-df-graph-bisimulation\">56-df-graph-bisimulation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e42d17d6f02097e2\" href=\"?note=e42d17d6f02097e2\" title=\"56-thm-term-graph-unravelling-homomorphism\">56-thm-term-graph-unravelling-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"faf9dd8d1400edec\" href=\"?note=faf9dd8d1400edec\" title=\"56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling\">56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 Definitions 13.2.7–13.2.9; cyclic access-path illustration"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"716–717"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>737</span><span>738</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,C\">\\(F,C\\)</span> 为互异符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\{F,C\\},\\{(F,2),(C,0)\\})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\{F,C\\},\\{(F,2),(C,0)\\})\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a> 的签名。</li>\n<li>项图、访问路径、终点、根可达性、展开、同态、同构和互模拟见相应依赖原子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon=()\">\\(\\epsilon=()\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 是序列连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_k\">\\(p_k\\)</span> 使用自然数递归构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\na\\coloneqq\\{(0,(1,0)),(1,())\\},\\quad\n\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{(0,F),(1,C)\\},\\quad\nG\\coloneqq(N,a,\\lambda,0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\na\\coloneqq\\{(0,(1,0)),(1,())\\},\\quad\n\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{(0,F),(1,C)\\},\\quad\nG\\coloneqq(N,a,\\lambda,0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_0\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\np_{k+1}\\coloneqq p_k\\cdot(2),\\qquad\nq_k\\coloneqq p_k\\cdot(1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_0\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\np_{k+1}\\coloneqq p_k\\cdot(2),\\qquad\nq_k\\coloneqq p_k\\cdot(1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootReachable}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootReachable}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_G=\n\\{p_k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{q_k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_G=\n\\{p_k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{q_k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{end}_G(p_k)=0\\land\n\\operatorname{end}_G(q_k)=1\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{end}_G(p_k)=0\\land\n\\operatorname{end}_G(q_k)=1\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{Acc}_G|=\\aleph_0\\land\n\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G),G,\\operatorname{end}_G)\n\\land\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G))\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(G,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{Acc}_G|=\\aleph_0\\land\n\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G),G,\\operatorname{end}_G)\n\\land\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G))\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(G,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是对原书访问路径示意的本地具体集合编码；根的第二条边回到根，第一条边到常元C。因此C有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1),(2,1),(2,2,1),\\ldots\">\\((1),(2,1),(2,2,1),\\ldots\\)</span> 等不同访问路径，访问树为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(C,F(C,F(C,\\ldots)))\">\\(F(C,F(C,F(C,\\ldots)))\\)</span>。未将OCR中的图形本身标记为已经逐像素核验。</p>\n<p>人工证明：任何合法路径在选1后立即到无出边叶节点，故必为若干个2或若干个2后接1；反向这些序列全部合法。两个序列族长度给出明确可数枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_k\">\\(p_k\\)</span> 长度互异保证无限。终点同态由上游定理；直接取终点同态的反向关系可得互模拟。原图仅有两个节点而展开节点可数无限，所以不存在双射同态。</p>\n<p>验证区分：有限深度访问枚举可复核前缀样本；关于所有自然数的访问刻画与非同构结论依据上述归纳和基数论证，并非有限枚举替代证明。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-access-path","status":"resolved","id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-access-path]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-unravelling","status":"resolved","id":"1c088d04d4303598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4a9c89b3e42d1880","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"9a89c52b489c33b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-term-graph-unravelling-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"e42d17d6f02097e2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-term-graph-unravelling-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling","status":"resolved","id":"faf9dd8d1400edec","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,C$ 为互异符号，$\\Sigma=(\\{F,C\\},\\{(F,2),(C,0)\\})$ 是 [[56-df-signature]] 的签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\{F,C\\},\\{(F,2),(C,0)\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon=()","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p_k","display":false},{"tex":"N\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\na\\coloneqq\\{(0,(1,0)),(1,())\\},\\quad\n\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{(0,F),(1,C)\\},\\quad\nG\\coloneqq(N,a,\\lambda,0).","display":true},{"tex":"p_0\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\np_{k+1}\\coloneqq p_k\\cdot(2),\\qquad\nq_k\\coloneqq p_k\\cdot(1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootReachable}(G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_G=\n\\{p_k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{q_k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{end}_G(p_k)=0\\land\n\\operatorname{end}_G(q_k)=1\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{Acc}_G|=\\aleph_0\\land\n\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G),G,\\operatorname{end}_G)\n\\land\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G))\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(G,\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)).","display":true},{"tex":"(1),(2,1),(2,2,1),\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"F(C,F(C,F(C,\\ldots)))","display":false},{"tex":"p_k","display":false}],"bytes":2969,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-352","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-term-graph-sharing-cycle.md]]"}],"outgoing":["53c31cee4a64d821","904f367f2b11cda0","7a4fa7874f12cc27","1c088d04d4303598","4a9c89b3e42d1880","9a89c52b489c33b7","e42d17d6f02097e2","faf9dd8d1400edec"]}